# IMPORTANT - why this file exists
#
# `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads the local directory to Cloud Build. When no
# .gcloudignore is present, gcloud DERIVES one from .gitignore. Our .gitignore excludes
# `artifacts/*.pkl`, so without this file the trained model would be silently dropped
# from the upload: the build succeeds, the service starts, and /health reports
# model_loaded=false (or worse, quietly serves the majority-class baseline).
#
# This file overrides that behaviour. artifacts/ is deliberately NOT excluded.

.git
.github
.gitignore

.venv
venv
env
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

# Confidential - must never leave the machine
data/

# Not needed at runtime
notebooks/
reports/
docs/
tests/
terraform/
scripts/
*.md
!README.md

.env
.DS_Store
docker-compose.yml

# NOTE: Dockerfile.frontend is intentionally NOT excluded - the frontend build needs it.

# NOTE: artifacts/ is intentionally absent from this list - the model must ship.
